<!--
  Single <url> entry is intentional, not an oversight: the site is
  built as one HTML document with JS-driven section switching
  (#fishing, #rules, etc. are not separate crawlable URLs to Google).
  If tightlinedslam.com is ever split into real subpages
  (fishing.html, rules.html, results.html...), each should get its
  own <url> block here with its own <lastmod>.

  The <image:image> entries below are real and do add value now
  Google indexes images from a page regardless of the page's own
  architecture, so this improves Google Images visibility for the
  tournament's actual photos.
-->
